{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"While TanStack offers a suite of first-party plugins, we also want to open the doors to third-party developers. Hence, we created the marketplace.\nTo be included in the marketplace registry, submit a PR to the "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack/devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" repository."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"inclusion-in-the-marketplace","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inclusion in the Marketplace"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To add your plugin, submit the required information to the following file:\n"},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/tabs/plugin-registry.ts","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"packages/devtools/src/tabs/plugin-registry.ts"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"example-entry","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example Entry"}]},{"type":"code","value":"'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.16.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'react',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"pull-request-format","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pull Request Format"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"As shown in the example above, the registry is an object with the following structure:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Key"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – Your package name"}]},{"type":"code","value":"'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': { PluginMetadata }","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Value"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – An object of type "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PluginMetadata"},{"type":"text","value":" with the following properties:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"packageName"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – The package’s name on npm"}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ packageName: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"title"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – The title of the plugin card"}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ title: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"description"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – A short description of your devtools "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ description?: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"logoUrl"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – The URL of the plugin’s logo "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ logoUrl?: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"loose":true,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"requires"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – An object containing the dependencies of your devtools "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"requires?: {\n  /** Required package name (e.g., '@tanstack/react-query') */\n  packageName: string\n  /** Minimum required version (semver) */\n  minVersion: string\n  /** Maximum version (if there’s a known breaking change) */\n  maxVersion?: string\n}","lang":"ts"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pluginImport"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – An object containing plugin import details "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"pluginImport?: {\n  /** The exact name to import from the package (e.g., 'FormDevtoolsPlugin' or 'ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel') */\n  importName: string\n  /** Whether this is a JSX component or a function returning a plugin */\n  type: 'jsx' | 'function'\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pluginId"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – A string representing a custom plugin ID "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ pluginId?: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"docsUrl"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – The URL to your plugin’s documentation "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ docsUrl?: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"author"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – The author’s name for credit "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ author?: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"repoUrl"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – The URL of the plugin’s repository "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(optional)"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ repoUrl?: string }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"framework"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – The framework supported by the plugin"}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ framework?: 'react' | 'solid' | 'vue' | 'svelte' | 'angular' | 'other' }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tags"}]},{"type":"text","value":" – Tags for filtering and categorization"}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"{ tags?: string[] }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"submitting-multiple-plugins","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Submitting Multiple Plugins"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can submit multiple plugins if you provide devtools for different frameworks.\nFor example, using the Pacer plugin from earlier, you might include a Solid version as well:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.16.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'react',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},\n'@tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/solid-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.14.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'solid',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"featured-plugins","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Featured Plugins"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The TanStack Marketplace includes a "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Featured"}]},{"type":"text","value":" section for official partners of the TanStack organization and select library authors we collaborate with."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To request inclusion, send an email to <partners+devtools@tanstack.com>."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"inclusion-in-the-marketplace","text":"Inclusion in the Marketplace","level":2},{"id":"example-entry","text":"Example Entry","level":3},{"id":"pull-request-format","text":"Pull Request Format","level":2},{"id":"submitting-multiple-plugins","text":"Submitting Multiple Plugins","level":2},{"id":"featured-plugins","text":"Featured Plugins","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nWhile TanStack offers a suite of first-party plugins, we also want to open the doors to third-party developers. Hence, we created the marketplace.\nTo be included in the marketplace registry, submit a PR to the [TanStack/devtools](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools) repository.\n\n## Inclusion in the Marketplace\n\nTo add your plugin, submit the required information to the following file:\n[`packages/devtools/src/tabs/plugin-registry.ts`](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/tabs/plugin-registry.ts)\n\n### Example Entry\n\n```tsx\n'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.16.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'react',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},\n```\n\n## Pull Request Format\n\nAs shown in the example above, the registry is an object with the following structure:\n\n**Key** – Your package name\n\n```tsx\n'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': { PluginMetadata }\n```\n\n**Value** – An object of type `PluginMetadata` with the following properties:\n\n- **`packageName`** – The package’s name on npm\n\n```ts\n{ packageName: string }\n```\n\n- **`title`** – The title of the plugin card\n\n```ts\n{ title: string }\n```\n\n- **`description`** – A short description of your devtools *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ description?: string }\n```\n\n- **`logoUrl`** – The URL of the plugin’s logo *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ logoUrl?: string }\n```\n\n- **`requires`** – An object containing the dependencies of your devtools *(optional)*\n\n  ```ts\n  requires?: {\n    /** Required package name (e.g., '@tanstack/react-query') */\n    packageName: string\n    /** Minimum required version (semver) */\n    minVersion: string\n    /** Maximum version (if there’s a known breaking change) */\n    maxVersion?: string\n  }\n  ```\n\n- **`pluginImport`** – An object containing plugin import details *(optional)*\n\n```ts\npluginImport?: {\n  /** The exact name to import from the package (e.g., 'FormDevtoolsPlugin' or 'ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel') */\n  importName: string\n  /** Whether this is a JSX component or a function returning a plugin */\n  type: 'jsx' | 'function'\n}\n  ```\n\n- **`pluginId`** – A string representing a custom plugin ID *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ pluginId?: string }\n```\n\n- **`docsUrl`** – The URL to your plugin’s documentation *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ docsUrl?: string }\n```\n\n- **`author`** – The author’s name for credit *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ author?: string }\n```\n\n- **`repoUrl`** – The URL of the plugin’s repository *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ repoUrl?: string }\n```\n\n- **`framework`** – The framework supported by the plugin\n\n```ts\n{ framework?: 'react' | 'solid' | 'vue' | 'svelte' | 'angular' | 'other' }\n```\n\n- **`tags`** – Tags for filtering and categorization\n\n```ts\n{ tags?: string[] }\n```\n\n## Submitting Multiple Plugins\n\nYou can submit multiple plugins if you provide devtools for different frameworks.\nFor example, using the Pacer plugin from earlier, you might include a Solid version as well:\n\n```tsx\n'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.16.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'react',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},\n'@tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/solid-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.14.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'solid',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},\n```\n\n## Featured Plugins\n\nThe TanStack Marketplace includes a *Featured* section for official partners of the TanStack organization and select library authors we collaborate with.\n\nTo request inclusion, send an email to <partners+devtools@tanstack.com>.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Third-party Plugins\nid: third-party-plugins\n---\n\nWhile TanStack offers a suite of first-party plugins, we also want to open the doors to third-party developers. Hence, we created the marketplace.\nTo be included in the marketplace registry, submit a PR to the [TanStack/devtools](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools) repository.\n\n## Inclusion in the Marketplace\n\nTo add your plugin, submit the required information to the following file:\n[`packages/devtools/src/tabs/plugin-registry.ts`](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/tabs/plugin-registry.ts)\n\n### Example Entry\n\n```tsx\n'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.16.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'react',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},\n```\n\n## Pull Request Format\n\nAs shown in the example above, the registry is an object with the following structure:\n\n**Key** – Your package name\n\n```tsx\n'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': { PluginMetadata }\n```\n\n**Value** – An object of type `PluginMetadata` with the following properties:\n\n- **`packageName`** – The package’s name on npm\n\n```ts\n{ packageName: string }\n```\n\n- **`title`** – The title of the plugin card\n\n```ts\n{ title: string }\n```\n\n- **`description`** – A short description of your devtools *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ description?: string }\n```\n\n- **`logoUrl`** – The URL of the plugin’s logo *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ logoUrl?: string }\n```\n\n- **`requires`** – An object containing the dependencies of your devtools *(optional)*\n\n  ```ts\n  requires?: {\n    /** Required package name (e.g., '@tanstack/react-query') */\n    packageName: string\n    /** Minimum required version (semver) */\n    minVersion: string\n    /** Maximum version (if there’s a known breaking change) */\n    maxVersion?: string\n  }\n  ```\n\n- **`pluginImport`** – An object containing plugin import details *(optional)*\n\n```ts\npluginImport?: {\n  /** The exact name to import from the package (e.g., 'FormDevtoolsPlugin' or 'ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel') */\n  importName: string\n  /** Whether this is a JSX component or a function returning a plugin */\n  type: 'jsx' | 'function'\n}\n  ```\n\n- **`pluginId`** – A string representing a custom plugin ID *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ pluginId?: string }\n```\n\n- **`docsUrl`** – The URL to your plugin’s documentation *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ docsUrl?: string }\n```\n\n- **`author`** – The author’s name for credit *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ author?: string }\n```\n\n- **`repoUrl`** – The URL of the plugin’s repository *(optional)*\n\n```ts\n{ repoUrl?: string }\n```\n\n- **`framework`** – The framework supported by the plugin\n\n```ts\n{ framework?: 'react' | 'solid' | 'vue' | 'svelte' | 'angular' | 'other' }\n```\n\n- **`tags`** – Tags for filtering and categorization\n\n```ts\n{ tags?: string[] }\n```\n\n## Submitting Multiple Plugins\n\nYou can submit multiple plugins if you provide devtools for different frameworks.\nFor example, using the Pacer plugin from earlier, you might include a Solid version as well:\n\n```tsx\n'@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/react-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.16.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'react',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},\n'@tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools': {\n  packageName: '@tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools',\n  title: 'Pacer Devtools',\n  description: 'Monitor and debug your Pacer animations and transitions',\n  requires: {\n    packageName: '@tanstack/solid-pacer',\n    minVersion: '0.14.4',\n  },\n  author: 'TanStack',\n  framework: 'solid',\n  tags: ['TanStack'],\n},\n```\n\n## Featured Plugins\n\nThe TanStack Marketplace includes a *Featured* section for official partners of the TanStack organization and select library authors we collaborate with.\n\nTo request inclusion, send an email to <partners+devtools@tanstack.com>.\n"}
